{%- comment -%}
  Renders the StrideWell wordmark from the hand-placed theme asset
  `assets/stridewell-logo.png`.

  This is the DEFAULT logo. It is only rendered when no logo has been chosen in
  Theme settings → Logo (header) or Theme settings → Brand (footer) — those
  pickers always win, so the merchant can override without touching code.

  Degrades gracefully: if `stridewell-logo.png` has not been added to /assets
  yet, the image removes itself on error and the shop name renders as text
  instead. No broken layout, no Liquid error.

  Two variants ship, because the deep-teal wordmark is invisible on the deep-teal
  footer:
  - stridewell-logo.png       teal wordmark, for light backgrounds (header)
  - stridewell-logo-light.png off-white wordmark, for dark backgrounds (footer)

  Accepts:
  - class: {String} extra classes for the <img>
  - width: {Number} rendered width in px (default 140)
  - height: {Number} rendered height in px, for CLS reservation.
      Defaults to the shipped artwork's 776x284 ratio (2.73:1).
  - light: {Boolean} use the off-white variant, for dark colour schemes
  - eager: {Boolean} load eagerly (use for the header logo)

  Usage:
  {%- render 'stridewell-logo', width: 140, eager: true -%}
  {%- render 'stridewell-logo', width: 140, light: true -%}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign logo_width = width | default: 140
  assign logo_height = height
  if logo_height == blank
    assign logo_height = logo_width | times: 284 | divided_by: 776
  endif

  assign logo_file = 'stridewell-logo.png'
  if light
    assign logo_file = 'stridewell-logo-light.png'
  endif
-%}

<div class="stridewell-logo" style="max-width: min(100%, {{ logo_width }}px);">
  <img
    src="{{ logo_file | asset_url }}"
    alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}"
    class="stridewell-logo__image {{ class }}"
    width="{{ logo_width }}"
    height="{{ logo_height }}"
    {% if eager %}loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}
    onerror="this.closest('.stridewell-logo').classList.add('stridewell-logo--missing'); this.remove();"
  >
  <span class="stridewell-logo__fallback h2">{{ shop.name }}</span>
</div>
